{"text": "From: Ittermann, Patti F.\nTo: Tucker, Tonya (LHC); Kendall, Sue (LHC)\nCC: Williard, JoAn M,; \u2018Dutton, David (LHC); Sterling, Carol (LHC); Bradt, Christine\n(LHC)\nBCC:\nPrimary Date; 11/19/1997 6:14:08 AM\nLast Modified Date: 1997-Dec-15 08:31:27\nLast Touched Dat\nSent Date: 1997-Nov-19 06:14:08\nReceived Date: 1997-Nov-19 06:14:08\nSubject: KAMEL/Out Magazine{F}\n\nthanks. as info, there is a POSSIBILITY that Salem\nMagazine, The CAMEL brand group has approved it, if Salem can work it out, for this\nbook only. David Dutton will work it out with you if Salem wants to pursue this option.\nNo action is needed on your part til then.\n\n\u2018We also identified several titles in which Salem is the only RJR brand for now. Joan will\nbe summarizing these. If at all possible, we'd like to avoid adding them to the\nCAMEL/KAMEL or WINSTON plans during the first half of the year at least.\n\n(Wetre doing this to help out Salem since it's trying to do a test market in the most\ncluttered city in the world -- and our other brands are trying to help them out without\ndestroying their own plans.)\n\nFrom: Tucker, Tonya\nTo: Ittermann, Patti F.\nSubject: RE: KAMEL/Out Magazine\nDate: Monday, November 17, 1997 5:26PM\n\n\u2018No problem. The schedule is listed out below.\n\nJanuary no issue\n\nFebruary spread\nMarch off\n\nApril page\nMay off\nJune spread\n\nLet me know if you need anything else.\n\nRJR0000000025007871\n\n70013 9014\n\n98e9 L623",
